        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌱 Garden Rivals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garden Rivals</strong> is a team-based competitive multiplayer game where strategy, bluffing, and chaos collide in fast-paced, intense matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in teams of two and battle around a central objective: <strong>the fertilizer</strong>. Sabotage, defend, deceive, and cast your spells at the right moment to gain the upper hand and lead your team to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match is different. Every decision matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Tactical, Fast-Paced Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short and intense matches, perfect for playing with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk management: attack, defend, or fake your intentions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focused on <strong>reading your opponents</strong>, not just reflexes</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧙‍♂️ Unique Classes to Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your playstyle among several classes with distinct mechanics:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blinker</strong> – mobility and repositioning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapper</strong> – area control and traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harbinger</strong> – pressure and long-range threats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echomage</strong> – strategy and action duplication</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class brings a new way to play… and to surprise your opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Online Multiplayer &amp; Team Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer for up to <strong>8 players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team-based gameplay (2v2)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrated voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic lobbies with team management</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordination and communication often make the difference.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎁 Progression &amp; Cosmetics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience-based progression system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seasonal <strong>Battle Pass</strong> with <strong>25 unlockable skins</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purely cosmetic rewards — no gameplay advantages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your look and show off your progression</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >❄️ Seasonal Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The winter season brings a wave of new content:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic snowy maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Updated visual and audio atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive seasonal rewards</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌼 A Game in Constant Evolution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garden Rivals</strong> is actively updated with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance adjustments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performance optimizations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI and usability improvements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Community feedback plays a key role in shaping the game’s future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌿 Enter the arena.</h2>",
